  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency and Economic Recuperation Program (EERP)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Emergencia y Recuperacin Econmica (EERP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE EERP OBJECTIVE IS TO SUPPOR THE REVIVAL OF ECONOMIC ACTIVITY IN HAITI BY MEANS: A) EMERGENCY WORKS AND REHABILITATION OF SOCIAL AND ECONOMIC INFRASTRUCTURE; AND B) A FRONT LOADED EMERGENCY IMPORTS COMPONENT. THE EERP WILL FOCUS ON PRIORITY EXPENDITURES OVER A PERIDO OF 12 TO 18 MONTHS FOLLOWING THE RESTORATION OF THE CONSTITUTIONAL GOVERNMENT. THE BANK&apos;S PARTICIPATION WILL BE DIRECTED TO THE AGRICULTURE, INFRASTRUCTURE, SANITATION AND ENERGY SECTOR INVESTMENTS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
